{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/audio-recorder-with-visualization/pulls/180","id":3935621456,"node_id":"PR_kwDOQyCEds7qlNFQ","html_url":"https://github.com/Jhon-Crow/audio-recorder-with-visualization/pull/180","diff_url":"https://github.com/Jhon-Crow/audio-recorder-with-visualization/pull/180.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Jhon-Crow/audio-recorder-with-visualization/pull/180.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/audio-recorder-with-visualization/issues/180","number":180,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix full album pipeline stage and added release controls","user":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n- Add and preserve the dependent full-album pipeline stage model from issue #179: album uploads remain per-track, while the derived full-album stage joins the already-rendered album videos into one upload/posting video.\n- Keep the derived stage configurable with its own title, description, timing interval, YouTube metadata, generated timestamp block from source track order/durations, fixed Album type controls, a thick solid gold border, and progress bar updates.\n- Fix the latest reviewer regression: stages added manually after `Clear` + `+` now use the release-stage editor, show `Release type` defaulted to `Album`, expose YouTube cover/release preset/full-album controls, and keep `Add full album stage` unchecked by default.\n- Disable YouTube settings and the stage-level YouTube button for visualization-only stages without resetting the stored metadata.\n- Preserve the investigation trail in `docs/case-studies/issue-179`, including refreshed issue/PR JSON, reviewer screenshots, local logs, external MDN references, and a Playwright after screenshot.\n\nFixes Jhon-Crow/audio-recorder-with-visualization#179\n\n## Visual Verification\n![Added stage release controls](https://github.com/konard/Jhon-Crow-audio-recorder-with-visualization/blob/issue-179-25c7a0b8b4a1/docs/case-studies/issue-179/after-release-type-added-stage.png?raw=true)\n\n## Tests\n- `npm run typecheck` passed.\n- `npm run lint` passed.\n- `node --check examples/pipeline.js` passed.\n- `npm test -- --runInBand` passed: 342 tests.\n- `npm run build` passed with existing Rollup warnings about package module type and `declarationDir`.\n- `npm run test:e2e -- --spec cypress/e2e/pipeline-mode.cy.js --config video=false`: 25 passing / 2 failing. The new manual added-stage release-control test passes, and the visualization-only YouTube disable test passes. Remaining failures are the previously observed stage navigator active-state assertion at `cypress/e2e/pipeline-mode.cy.js:256` and relative publish-date assertion at `cypress/e2e/pipeline-mode.cy.js:396`.","created_at":"2026-06-25T13:38:04Z","updated_at":"2026-06-26T08:42:38Z","closed_at":"2026-06-26T08:42:37Z","merged_at":"2026-06-26T08:42:37Z","merge_commit_sha":"8ed4d31151dc40c84cb5b354e667100c3382a93a","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/audio-recorder-with-visualization/pu